ing  lumafusion to the galaxy store which is  that video editing app on tablets which  could make it even more powerful so then  do i recommend it  well  you gotta know what you want and if you  were looking for a tablet that actually  fits the ultra name this is the first  one that actually does it the huge  screen is kind of unrivaled than any  other tablet  and then it's so capable with decks and  with all this other stuff they've built  in that it's actually genuinely one of  the most versatile computers  you can get  so that's been it thanks for watching  catch you guys the next one  peace  [Music]

